ZVSE2

** LIGHTNING BOOTS - combination artifact (feet slot)
**
** Parts: Equestrian's Gloves (70) + Boots of Speed (98).
** When combined, the parts no longer count as equipped: their movement bonus (+300 / +600) and the
** Advanced Classes Mod "Priest of the Light" set piece (Boots of Speed) are gone. Instead, only while
** the boots are equipped (not in the backpack):
**   - +1000 land movement points
**   - all creatures of the hero's army: +1 combat speed (not war machines)
**   - the hero has Grandmaster Logistics (Advanced Classes Mod): a hero without Logistics or with a
**     lower level gets Expert Logistics + the Master and Grandmaster upgrades; when the boots are
**     taken off, the hero's own Logistics level comes back.
** Price: the sum of its parts (3000 + 6000).
**
** Artifact 284, combination slot 26. Icon: artifact.def frame 284 and Emerald's artraits.txt row 284
** (Data/EmeraldArtifacts.pac and Data/00 forge and fury.pac), png in Data/forge and fury.zip.
** Enabled/disabled in WoG Options -> Custom Scripts, option 955 "Custom Artifacts" (shared by all new artifacts).

; ============= SETTINGS ===========================================================================

!#DC(LB_OPTION)             = 955;       [shared option "Custom Artifacts"]
!#DC(LB_ART)                = 284;
!#DC(LB_COMBO_SLOT)         = 26;       [ResOunD: 13-22, Pegasus Harness: 23, Minerjack: 24, Eye of Providence: 25]
!#DC(LB_COST)               = 9000;
!#DC(LB_ART_CLASS)          = 16;       [Relic]
!#DC(LB_ART_POSITION)       = 8;        [Feet (ERM Format P2)]

!#DC(LB_MOVEMENT_BONUS)     = 1000;     [land movement points]
!#DC(LB_SPEED_BONUS)        = 1;        [combat speed of all creatures]
!#DC(LB_MAX_SKILLS)         = 10;       [secondary skill slots (10SSkills)]

!#UN:P(LB_OPTION)/?i^lb_enabled^;
!#VRi^lb_enabled^|i^cr_hasResound^<>(TRUE):S(FALSE); [needs Resound, see "31 forge and fury - dependencies.erm"]

; Named globals are stored in savegames, so re-read the option after a game is started or loaded
!?FU(OnStartOrLoad);
!!UN:P(LB_OPTION)/?i^lb_enabled^;
!!VRi^lb_enabled^|i^cr_hasResound^<>(TRUE):S(FALSE); [needs Resound, see "31 forge and fury - dependencies.erm"]

; ============= ARTIFACT SETUP =====================================================================

!?FU(LB_SetUpArtifact);
!!UN:A(LB_ART)/1/(LB_COST);
!!UN:A(LB_ART)/2/(LB_ART_POSITION);
!!UN:A(LB_ART)/3/(LB_ART_CLASS);
!!UN:A(LB_ART)/1;                        [never appears on the map: it is only made from its parts]

!!SN:H^art^/(LB_ART)/0/^Lightning Boots^;
!!SN:H^art^/(LB_ART)/1/^{Lightning Boots}

Forged from the Equestrian's Gloves and the Boots of Speed, these boots carry their wearer like a bolt of lightning.

While worn:
- +1000 land movement points.
- All creatures in the army get +1 Speed in combat.
- The hero has Grandmaster Logistics.^;

!!UN:A(LB_COMBO_SLOT)/(LB_ART)/(ART_EQUESTRIANS_GLOVES)/(ART_BOOTS_OF_SPEED);

!#FU(LB_SetUpArtifact)&i^lb_enabled^:P;

!?FU(OnAfterLoadGame)&i^lb_enabled^;
!!FU(LB_SetUpArtifact):P;

; ============= HELPERS ============================================================================

; Is the artifact equipped? (change = +1 / -1 when called from OnEquipArt / OnUnequipArt, because
; there the artifact is not yet / still in its slot)
!?FU(LB_IsEquipped);
!#VA(hero:x) (change:x) (result:x);

!!VR(result):S(FALSE);
!!FU&(hero)<=(NO_HERO):E;
!!HE(hero):A2/(LB_ART)/?(count:y)/?(equipped:y);
!!VR(equipped):+(change);
!!VR(result)&(equipped)>0:S(TRUE);

; ============= GRANDMASTER LOGISTICS ==============================================================
; Hero variables (kept in savegames on purpose, they belong to the hero):
;   i^lb_granted_<hero>^  TRUE while the boots give the skill
;   i^lb_level_<hero>^, i^lb_master_<hero>^, i^lb_grandmaster_<hero>^  the hero's own values

!?FU(LB_SyncLogistics);
!#VA(hero:x) (change:x);

!!FU&(hero)<=(NO_HERO):E;
!!FU(LB_IsEquipped):P(hero)/(change)/?(wearing:y);
!!VR(wearing)&i^lb_enabled^<>1:S(FALSE);  [option switched off: give the hero's own Logistics back]
!!VR(granted:y):Si^lb_granted_%(hero)^;

!!if&(wearing)/(granted)<>(TRUE);
  !!HE(hero):S(SKILL_LOGISTICS)/?(level:y);
  !!SN:W^H3_Logistics_0_Hero%(hero)^/?(master:y);
  !!SN:W^H3_Logistics_1_Hero%(hero)^/?(grandmaster:y);
  !!FU&(level)>=(SKILL_EXPERT)/(master)=1/(grandmaster)=1:E;   [already Grandmaster]

  ; A new skill needs a free secondary skill slot
  !!if&(level)=0;
    !!VR(numSkills:y):S0;
    !!re i/0/27;
      !!HE(hero):Si/?(skillLevel:y);
      !!VR(numSkills)&(skillLevel)>0:+1;
    !!en;
    !!FU&(numSkills)>=(LB_MAX_SKILLS):E;
  !!en;

  !!VRi^lb_level_%(hero)^:S(level);
  !!VRi^lb_master_%(hero)^:S(master);
  !!VRi^lb_grandmaster_%(hero)^:S(grandmaster);
  !!VRi^lb_granted_%(hero)^:S(TRUE);

  !!HE(hero):S(SKILL_LOGISTICS)/(SKILL_EXPERT);
  !!SN:W^H3_Logistics_0_Hero%(hero)^/1;
  !!SN:W^H3_Logistics_1_Hero%(hero)^/1;
!!el&(wearing)<>(TRUE)/(granted);
  !!HE(hero):S(SKILL_LOGISTICS)/i^lb_level_%(hero)^;
  !!SN:W^H3_Logistics_0_Hero%(hero)^/i^lb_master_%(hero)^;
  !!SN:W^H3_Logistics_1_Hero%(hero)^/i^lb_grandmaster_%(hero)^;
  !!VRi^lb_granted_%(hero)^:S(FALSE);
!!en;

!?FU(OnEquipArt)&i^lb_enabled^/v998=(LB_ART);
!!HE-1:N?(hero:y);
!!FU(LB_SyncLogistics):P(hero)/1;

!?FU(OnUnequipArt)&i^lb_enabled^/v998=(LB_ART);
!!HE-1:N?(hero:y);
!!FU(LB_SyncLogistics):P(hero)/-1;

; Safety checks (combining the parts, trading between heroes, option switched off)
!?FU(OnCloseHeroScreen);
!!HE-1:N?(hero:y);
!!FU(LB_SyncLogistics):P(hero)/0;

!?FU(OnEveryDay)&i^timerOnce^=1;
!!re i/(HERO_FIRST)/(HERO_LAST_WOG);
  !!FU(LB_SyncLogistics):Pi/0;
!!en;

!?FU(OnBeforeBattleUniversal)&i^lb_enabled^;
!!re i/(BATTLE_LEFT)/(BATTLE_RIGHT);
  !!FU(LB_SyncLogistics):Pi^battle_hero_%i^/0;
!!en;

; ============= +1000 LAND MOVEMENT POINTS =========================================================
; ERA Scripts calls this function when a hero's movement points for the day are set (final result).

!?FU(ES_OnSetHeroMovementPoints)&i^lb_enabled^;
!#VA(hook:x);

!!UN:C(hook)/(STRUCT_HOOK_CONTEXT_EBX)/(UNC_INT)/?(heroStruct:y);
!!UN:C(heroStruct)/26/(UNC_INT)/?(hero:y);

!!FU(LB_IsEquipped):P(hero)/0/?(wearing:y);
!!FU&(wearing)<>(TRUE):E;

!!HE(hero):P?(posX:y)/?(posY:y)/?(posZ:y);
!!TR(posX)/(posY)/(posZ):T?(terrain:y)/?i/?i/?i/?i/?i/?i/?i;
!!FU&(terrain)=8:E;                      [on water: no bonus]

!!VR(extraMp:y):S(LB_MOVEMENT_BONUS);
!!VR(extraMp)&i^wog_101_map_rule_10_isEnabled^:*2;   [WoG map rule: double movement]
!!UN:C(hook)/(STRUCT_HOOK_CONTEXT_EAX)/(UNC_INT)/d(extraMp);

; ============= +1 COMBAT SPEED ====================================================================

!?FU(OnBattleRound)&i^lb_enabled^/i^battle_round^=0;
!!FU(LB_ApplySpeed):P(BATTLE_LEFT) P(BATTLE_RIGHT);

!?FU(LB_ApplySpeed);
!#VA(side:x);

!!FU(LB_IsEquipped):Pi^battle_hero_%(side)^/0/?(wearing:y);
!!FU&(wearing)<>(TRUE):E;

!!VR(first:y):S(BATTLE_ATTACKER_STACK_FIRST);
!!VR(last:y):S(BATTLE_ATTACKER_STACK_LAST);
!!VR(first)&(side)=(BATTLE_RIGHT):S(BATTLE_DEFENDER_STACK_FIRST);
!!VR(last)&(side)=(BATTLE_RIGHT):S(BATTLE_DEFENDER_STACK_LAST);

!!re i/(first)/(last);
  !!BMi:T?(type:y) N?(num:y);
  !!co&(num)<=0;
  !!co&(type)>=(MON_CATAPULT)/(type)<=(MON_ARROW_TOWERS);  [war machines and towers]
  !!BMi:Sd(LB_SPEED_BONUS);
!!en;
